4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need to fix the fee structure. Costs have shifted, and we must decide how to handle it fairly for everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Fairness is easy to say, hard to collect. I’d like to know what the next treasurer actually faces before we pick a method.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I’d like to understand the actual usage patterns first. Who is really showing up, and who is just paying?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The hesitation is real. People are weighing whether to show up at all. We need to fix that friction before we talk numbers.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: The hesitation is real. People are weighing whether to show up at all. We need to fix that friction before we talk numbers.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I refuse to guess. We need hard numbers on what we can actually count on coming in, not just what we hope for.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, your point about the workload is valid. But we also need to see how the current system affects attendance. Let’s look at the data.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, agreed. But I need to see the hours logged by the last treasurer. If the job is a nightmare, no fee structure will save us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, that hesitation might just be the cost of feeling like a guest. I want to see the sign-in sheets to know who is actually here.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, the sign-in sheets only show who came, not why they hesitate. I need to see the taster forms to understand why people drift away.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, checking the hours is smart. But I need the bank statements too. I want to see exactly when money actually hits the account, not just when it’s promised.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, taster forms show why people leave, not why they hesitate. I need the winter social feedback to understand the current mood.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the winter social is anecdotal. I need the ledger to see where the money actually goes. @Takumi, the bank statements will show the cash flow reality.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the ledger shows where money goes, not who carries the weight. I need the rota against attendance to see who does the work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the winter social is just a snapshot. I need the weekday turnout to see if the hesitation is actually killing our regulars.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is vital. I need to see the bank statements to track actual cash flow, and the ledger to verify the real costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is essential. I will check the winter social feedback and the sign-in sheets to see who is actually present.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the outgoing treasurer’s logged hours and the ledger. I need to know the true cost of the job and where the money goes.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll check the sign-in sheets and the rota against attendance. I need to see who is actually here and who is doing the work.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the weekday turnout and the taster evening forms. I need to see if the hesitation is killing our regulars and why newcomers drift away.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I’m checking the bank statements and the ledger. I need to know exactly what we can count on, not just what we hope for.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
