70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, the data proves tiers alienate people. We need one simple fee to keep the doors open and the books clean. I stand by my vote for the flat annual fee.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, the ledger proves fixed costs dominate. Tiers add complexity without solving the core problem. I stand by my vote for the flat annual fee.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
